//! The `scrollbar-width` property allows the author to set the desired thickness of an element's
//! scrollbars when they are shown.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: The default scrollbar width for the platform.
//! - none: No scrollbar shown, however the element will still be scrollable.
//! - thin: A thin scrollbar width variant on platforms that provide that option, or a thinner
//! scrollbar than the default platform scrollbar width.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | thin | none
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scrollbars-1/#propdef-scrollbar-width
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/scrollbar-width
//!
